d 'NESTPRESERVE': module  to preserve, inspect, and restore multiple nested dataset states
d
d  nestpreserve provides a disk-backed, last-in–first-out stack
d of dataset-state checkpoints. It allows each Stata frame to save,
d inspect, and restore multiple analytical states while enforcing
d frame ownership and restoration order. The module automatically
d records checkpoint dimensions, variable and observation changes,
d dataset signatures, and transaction history. nesttransaction:
d runs a command and automatically rolls back its dataset changes
d after either success or failure. nestrecover and nestclear
d provide fail-closed recovery and cleanup after a Stata process
d ends, acting automatically only when exactly one intact abandoned
d checkpoint stack is identified and its originating process is
d proven dead. Ambiguous, live, corrupt, legacy, or otherwise
d unverifiable candidates are not modified automatically. The
d module manages the dataset state rather than the complete Stata
d session. 
d
d KW: data management
d KW: nested data states; dataset checkpoints; transaction rollback; data audit; crash recovery; frames
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260825
d
d Author: Hao Ma,  NA
d Support: email shouhuoxiwang2027@@gmail.com
d
f nestpreserve.ado
f nestpreserve.sthlp
f nestclear.ado
f nestclear.sthlp
f nestpreserve-process.jar
f nestrecover.ado
f nestrecover.sthlp
f nestrestore.ado
f nestrestore.sthlp
f neststatus.ado
f neststatus.sthlp
f nesttransaction.ado
f nesttransaction.sthlp
f ../_/_nestpreserve_audit.ado
f ../_/_nestpreserve_manifest.ado
f ../_/_nestpreserve_process.ado
